 "remarks": "Don't miss this lovingly cared for 3 BR Ranch style home in Norwalk's highly sought-after Wolfpit neighborhood! New Vinyl plank flooring throughout/newer central air conditioning & above ground oil tank. Additional rooms include office and large den/family room with access to fenced in backyard. Central air, generator, oil heat (Tenant must contract with Standard Oil for auto refills. No use of the fireplace per lease.. Must have excellent credit. Please send application, credit report, background and photo ID as 1 PDF. No tenant supplied credit reports. Use RentSpree or your office's program. Truly a great neighborhood to live in!",
